+ /*----------------------------------------------------------------------
+        Call system gethostname
+ 
+   Args: hostname -- buffer to return host name in 
+         size     -- Size of buffer hostname is to be returned in
+ 
+  Result: returns 0 if the hostname is correctly set,
+          -1 if not (and errno is set).
